</p>
<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\"><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div>
<ul>
<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Introduction\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Introduction</span></a></li>
<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Orientation_to_the_Software_.28ControlPanel_and_Views.29\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Orientation to the Software (ControlPanel and Views)</span></a></li>
<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#The_Graph_View\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Graph View</span></a></li>
<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Spiking_Behavior\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Spiking Behavior</span></a></li>
