svn rev: 415305 updated for 8.5 with new kna_adapt params, new spike act_eq fit and updated params for spikevsrate fit



<li>Tue Mar 14 22:47:48 2017 version: 8.0.11 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: sorry last change was with 8.0.6 -- now doing vm init = .3 with 8.0.4



<li>Fri Jan 13 02:49:01 2017 version: 8.0.10 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: 10446 8.0.4 update



<li>Wed Jan 11 02:49:40 2017 version: 8.0.9 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: actually, change line width to 1 -- use screen-specific prefs (expert) if not thick enough for your display



<li>Wed Jan 11 02:47:37 2017 version: 8.0.8 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: saved with emergent 8.0.4 -- no other changes



<li>Wed Sep  7 14:09:05 2016 version: 8.0.7 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
svn rev: 414170 no toolbar



<li>Wed Sep  7 14:07:53 2016 version: 8.0.6 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: got rid of app toolbar



<li>Thu Sep  1 03:42:43 2016 version: 8.0.5 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
svn rev: 414161 misc updates uploaded to wiki



<li>Thu Sep  1 03:41:42 2016 version: 8.0.4 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: defaults don't change ex flag.  and SpikeVsRate restores fast=false at end..



<li>Thu Sep  1 03:28:35 2016 version: 8.0.3 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: changed spike_misc.t_r to 0 instead of 3 -- makes graph much easier to read.  probably should reset I_net right away even with refractory.  turned ex flag on by default -- don't need NoExp because we have this flag!  Added stochastic sampling to SpikeVsRate to smooth over the sampling issues -- very close match now!



<li>Wed Aug 17 23:45:08 2016 version: 8.0.2 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
Project updated on wiki: CCN changes: all latest code


<li>Tue Aug 16 00:02:28 2016 version: 8.0.1 user: oreilly file_name: <code>neuron.proj</code> <br>
Updated to 8.0 specs and programs.  No major changes.  Did add new short-term-plasticity (stp) specs on unit spec -- can be used to explore synaptic depression and potentiation.


</ul>
</body>
</html>
";
